# The control for Uro escaping with the Lotus Petals sacrificed for its mana (CR 601.2g-h, 702.138a): with three other
# cards in the graveyard and one Lotus Petal left, sacrificing it while Uro is cast would leave only four other cards for
# "Exile five other cards from your graveyard", so the escape is not offered at all, with mana to spare or not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Uro, Titan of Nature's Wrath
Lotus Petal
Lotus Petal
Lotus Petal
Black Lotus
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Uro, Titan of Nature's Wrath.Cast
Bot1.Triggers(sacrifice it unless; gain 3 life and draw)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
! Bot1.Graveyard.Uro, Titan of Nature's Wrath.Cast(Ability: Escape)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Lotus Petal; Mox Emerald; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard = Lotus Petal; Black Lotus; Uro, Titan of Nature's Wrath; Lotus Petal
Exile.Count = 0
